   "format": "[General]",
   "expression": "'Management Club record reveals that a sum of Rs. ' + STRING(abs(balance), '###,###,##0.00') +  ' is outstanding against you and~r~nhas not been settled till due date of  '+string(ad_duedate,'dd/mm/yy')+'~r~n~r~nYou will appreciate that affairs of the club are managed out of meager financial resources. Most of~r~nthe time, these finances are tied-up in such type of circular debt. Delayed payment by valued members~r~ncauses adverse effect on day to day operations of the Club.~r~n~r~nTo ensure smooth operation of the Club, your are requested to kindly settle all of your outstanding~r~ndues latest by ' +string(ad_lastdate,'dd/mm/yy')+' so that Club Committtee is in a position to serve its valued members in ~r~nan effective manner.~r~n~r~nYour cooperation in this regard shall be highly appreciated please.~r~n~r~nRegards,~r~n~r~n~r~nSecretary~r~nManagement Club Committee'",
